---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Which Desire Experience Matches Your Vacation Style?"
description: "Take our 60-second quiz to find out whether Desire Riviera Maya or Desire Pearl better matches your vacation pace."
permalink: "/quiz/"
---
<section class="quiz-container page container">
  <div class="quiz-header text-center">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">Vacation Fit Quiz</span>
    <h1>Which Desire Experience Fits Your Vacation Style?</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: var(--max-paragraph); margin: 0 auto 36px; color: var(--color-espresso-soft);">
      Five quick questions about how you like to spend your time. Your result is a starting point for comparing Desire Riviera Maya and Desire Pearl, not a substitute for checking the current details of each resort.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div id="quiz-card" class="card quiz-card">
    <div class="quiz-progress">
      <span id="step-indicator" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Question 1 of 5</span>
      <div class="progress-bar-track" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuemax="5" aria-valuenow="1" aria-label="Quiz progress">
        <div id="progress-bar-fill" style="width: 20%;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-step" data-q="1">
      <h2>How would you most enjoy a typical afternoon?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="romantic-retreat">
          <strong>Relaxed & Low-Key</strong>
          <span>Pool or beach time, a good book, a drink together, and plenty of time to yourselves.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="balanced-explorer">
          <strong>A Little of Everything</strong>
          <span>Some quiet time, some socializing, and the freedom to decide as the afternoon unfolds.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="social-celebration">
          <strong>Social & Lively</strong>
          <span>Music, pool activity, meeting other couples, and being part of whatever is happening.</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-step" data-q="2" style="display: none;">
      <h2>What kind of evening sounds most appealing?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="romantic-retreat">
          <strong>Dinner, Drinks & Conversation</strong>
          <span>A slower evening with good food, cocktails, music, and time to reconnect.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="balanced-explorer">
          <strong>Dinner, Then See What Happens</strong>
          <span>You enjoy entertainment and social time, but you do not need every night to be a late one.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="social-celebration">
          <strong>Theme Nights & Dancing</strong>
          <span>You want to dress up, join the party, meet people, and keep the evening going.</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-step" data-q="3" style="display: none;">
      <h2>How important is having a quieter place to retreat?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="romantic-retreat">
          <strong>Very Important</strong>
          <span>Our room should feel like a peaceful escape when we want a break from resort activity.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="balanced-explorer">
          <strong>Nice to Have</strong>
          <span>We like a comfortable retreat, but being reasonably close to activity is also useful.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="social-celebration">
          <strong>Not a Big Priority</strong>
          <span>We would rather be close to the pool, entertainment, and places where people gather.</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-step" data-q="4" style="display: none;">
      <h2>When it comes to meeting other couples, what sounds most like you?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="romantic-retreat">
          <strong>Mostly Our Own Bubble</strong>
          <span>We enjoy the lifestyle atmosphere, but most of our vacation time is about the two of us.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="balanced-explorer">
          <strong>Open to It</strong>
          <span>We like meeting people naturally without feeling like we have to be social all the time.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="social-celebration">
          <strong>Bring on the Social Scene</strong>
          <span>Meeting people and becoming part of the social atmosphere is a big part of the fun for us.</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-step" data-q="5" style="display: none;">
      <h2>Which vacation pace sounds most like your ideal?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="romantic-retreat">
          <strong>Unhurried</strong>
          <span>We want room in the schedule for long mornings, downtime, and spontaneous quiet moments.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="balanced-explorer">
          <strong>Flexible</strong>
          <span>We like having options and choosing between relaxation and activity from day to day.</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="social-celebration">
          <strong>Full & Energetic</strong>
          <span>We would rather have plenty happening and make the most of the resort's social calendar.</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="quiz-result" class="quiz-result" role="region" aria-live="polite" aria-labelledby="result-label" tabindex="-1" style="display: none; margin-top: 32px;">
      <span class="pill-label">Your Vacation Style</span>
      <h2 id="result-label" style="margin: 16px 0 8px;"></h2>
      <h3 id="result-resort" style="color: var(--color-teal); margin: 0 0 16px;"></h3>
      <p id="result-trigger" class="lead-text" style="color: var(--color-espresso-soft); margin-bottom: 20px;"></p>
      
      <div class="result-details" style="background: var(--color-canvas); padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px;"><strong>Room approach:</strong> <span id="result-wing"></span></p>
        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>This may appeal to:</strong> <span id="result-best"></span></p>
      </div>

      <p class="small-text" style="color: var(--color-espresso-soft); margin-bottom: 20px;">Resort offerings, room categories, entertainment, and schedules can change. Use your result as a starting point, then review the current resort details before booking.</p>

      <div class="result-actions" style="display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a id="result-link" href="#" class="btn btn--outline">Explore This Match</a>
        <a href="/compare/" class="btn btn--outline">Compare the Resorts</a>
        <a href="/#availability" class="btn btn--primary">Check Availability</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  window.QUIZ_SEGMENTS = {{ segments | dump | safe }};
</script>
<script src="/js/filter-engine.js" defer></script>